---
import PrimaryButton from '../../ui/PrimaryButton.astro';
---
<section class="section">
  <div class="section-gap">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-header center">
        <div class="badge">
          <div class="badge-dot"></div>
          <div>FAQ</div>
        </div>
        <div class="max-width-30">
          <h2 class="section-heading center">Have questions? We&#x27;re here to help</h2>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="faq-wrap">
        <div to-top-2="" data-current="Tab 1" data-easing="ease" data-duration-in="300" data-duration-out="100" class="w-tabs">
          <div to-top-2="" class="faq-tab-menu center w-tab-menu">
            <a data-w-tab="Tab 1" class="doctor-tab-link light w-inline-block w-tab-link w--current">
              <div>Andrology Specialist</div>
            </a>
            <a data-w-tab="Tab 2" class="doctor-tab-link light w-inline-block w-tab-link">
              <div>Endocrinologist</div>
            </a>
            <a data-w-tab="Tab 3" class="doctor-tab-link light w-inline-block w-tab-link">
              <div>Women&#x27;s Hormone</div>
            </a>
          </div>
          <div class="w-tab-content">
            <div data-w-tab="Tab 1" class="w-tab-pane w--tab-active">
              <div class="faq-list">
                <div to-top-2="" class="faq-item">
                  <div class="faq-question">
                    <div class="faq-icon-wrap"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="100%" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none" class="faq-icon">
                        <path d="M10 3.33337V16.6667" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.44444" stroke-linejoin="round"></path>
                        <path d="M3.33301 10H16.6663" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.44444" stroke-linejoin="round"></path>
                      </svg></div>
                    <h3 class="faq-question-text">What does an andrology specialist treat?</h3>
                  </div>
                  <div class="faq-answer-wrap">
                    <div class="faq-answer">
                      <p class="faq-answer-text">An andrologist looks after male reproductive health, including low sperm count, hormone imbalance and erectile problems. You get a full assessment and a treatment plan made for you.</p>
                    </div>
                  </div>
                </div>
                <div to-top-2="" class="faq-item">
                  <div class="faq-question">
                    <div class="faq-icon-wrap"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="100%" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none" class="faq-icon">
                        <path d="M10 3.33337V16.6667" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.44444" stroke-linejoin="round"></path>
                        <path d="M3.33301 10H16.6663" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.44444" stroke-linejoin="round"></path>
                      </svg></div>
                    <h3 class="faq-question-text">How is a semen analysis done?</h3>
                  </div>
                  <div class="faq-answer-wrap">
                    <div class="faq-answer">
                      <p class="faq-answer-text">You provide a sample in a private room at the clinic. Results are usually ready in two to three days, and your specialist explains them with you.</p>
                    </div>
                  </div>
                </div>
                <div to-top-2="" class="faq-item">
                  <div class="faq-question">
                    <div class="faq-icon-wrap"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="100%" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none" class="faq-icon">
                        <path d="M10 3.33337V16.6667" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.44444" stroke-linejoin="round"></path>
                        <path d="M3.33301 10H16.6663" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.44444" stroke-linejoin="round"></path>
                      </svg></div>
                    <h3 class="faq-question-text">Can lifestyle changes improve sperm health?</h3>
                  </div>
                  <div class="faq-answer-wrap">
                    <div class="faq-answer">
                      <p class="faq-answer-text">Yes. Stopping smoking, cutting back on alcohol, keeping a healthy weight and managing stress can all make a real difference over a few months.</p>
                    </div>
                  </div>
                </div>
                <div to-top-2="" class="faq-item">
                  <div class="faq-question">
                    <div class="faq-icon-wrap"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="100%" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none" class="faq-icon">
                        <path d="M10 3.33337V16.6667" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.44444" stroke-linejoin="round"></path>
                        <path d="M3.33301 10H16.6663" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.44444" stroke-linejoin="round"></path>
                      </svg></div>
                    <h3 class="faq-question-text">Is male fertility testing painful?</h3>
                  </div>
                  <div class="faq-answer-wrap">
                    <div class="faq-answer">
                      <p class="faq-answer-text">No. Most tests use a simple sample or a routine blood test. If anything more is needed, your specialist talks you through it first.</p>
                    </div>
                  </div>
                </div>
                <div to-top-2="" class="faq-item">
                  <div class="faq-question">
                    <div class="faq-icon-wrap"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="100%" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none" class="faq-icon">
                        <path d="M10 3.33337V16.6667" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.44444" stroke-linejoin="round"></path>
                        <path d="M3.33301 10H16.6663" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.44444" stroke-linejoin="round"></path>
                      </svg></div>
                    <h3 class="faq-question-text">How long until treatment shows results?</h3>
                  </div>
                  <div class="faq-answer-wrap">
                    <div class="faq-answer">
                      <p class="faq-answer-text">Sperm take around three months to develop, so most men see changes in follow-up tests after about three months of treatment.</p>
                    </div>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div data-w-tab="Tab 2" class="w-tab-pane">
              <div class="faq-list">
                <div class="faq-item">
                  <div class="faq-question">
                    <div class="faq-icon-wrap"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="100%" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none" class="faq-icon">
                        <path d="M10 3.33337V16.6667" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.44444" stroke-linejoin="round"></path>
                        <path d="M3.33301 10H16.6663" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.44444" stroke-linejoin="round"></path>
                      </svg></div>
                    <h3 class="faq-question-text">Why see a reproductive endocrinologist?</h3>
                  </div>
                  <div class="faq-answer-wrap active">
                    <div class="faq-answer">
                      <p class="faq-answer-text">A reproductive endocrinologist specialises in the hormones that control fertility. They find the cause of difficulty conceiving and guide you to the right treatment.</p>
                    </div>
                  </div>
                </div>
                <div class="faq-item">
                  <div class="faq-question">
                    <div class="faq-icon-wrap"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="100%" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none" class="faq-icon">
                        <path d="M10 3.33337V16.6667" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.44444" stroke-linejoin="round"></path>
                        <path d="M3.33301 10H16.6663" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.44444" stroke-linejoin="round"></path>
                      </svg></div>
                    <h3 class="faq-question-text">Which hormone tests will I need?</h3>
                  </div>
                  <div class="faq-answer-wrap">
                    <div class="faq-answer">
                      <p class="faq-answer-text">Most people start with simple blood tests such as AMH, FSH, LH, thyroid and prolactin. Your doctor chooses tests based on your history.</p>
                    </div>
                  </div>
                </div>
                <div class="faq-item">
                  <div class="faq-question">
                    <div class="faq-icon-wrap"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="100%" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none" class="faq-icon">
                        <path d="M10 3.33337V16.6667" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.44444" stroke-linejoin="round"></path>
                        <path d="M3.33301 10H16.6663" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.44444" stroke-linejoin="round"></path>
                      </svg></div>
                    <h3 class="faq-question-text">Can thyroid problems affect fertility?</h3>
                  </div>
                  <div class="faq-answer-wrap">
                    <div class="faq-answer">
                      <p class="faq-answer-text">Yes. An over or underactive thyroid can disrupt ovulation and cycles. Once it is treated, many people find it easier to conceive.</p>
                    </div>
                  </div>
                </div>
                <div class="faq-item">
                  <div class="faq-question">
                    <div class="faq-icon-wrap"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="100%" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none" class="faq-icon">
                        <path d="M10 3.33337V16.6667" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.44444" stroke-linejoin="round"></path>
                        <path d="M3.33301 10H16.6663" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.44444" stroke-linejoin="round"></path>
                      </svg></div>
                    <h3 class="faq-question-text">How is PCOS treated?</h3>
                  </div>
                  <div class="faq-answer-wrap">
                    <div class="faq-answer">
                      <p class="faq-answer-text">Treatment depends on your goals. It can include lifestyle support, medication to help you ovulate and, if needed, IUI or IVF.</p>
                    </div>
                  </div>
                </div>
                <div class="faq-item">
                  <div class="faq-question">
                    <div class="faq-icon-wrap"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="100%" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none" class="faq-icon">
                        <path d="M10 3.33337V16.6667" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.44444" stroke-linejoin="round"></path>
                        <path d="M3.33301 10H16.6663" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.44444" stroke-linejoin="round"></path>
                      </svg></div>
                    <h3 class="faq-question-text">Do I need a referral to book?</h3>
                  </div>
                  <div class="faq-answer-wrap">
                    <div class="faq-answer">
                      <p class="faq-answer-text">No referral is needed. You can book a consultation directly, and we will request any past results from your doctor with your permission.</p>
                    </div>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div data-w-tab="Tab 3" class="w-tab-pane">
              <div class="faq-list">
                <div class="faq-item">
                  <div class="faq-question">
                    <div class="faq-icon-wrap"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="100%" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none" class="faq-icon">
                        <path d="M10 3.33337V16.6667" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.44444" stroke-linejoin="round"></path>
                        <path d="M3.33301 10H16.6663" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.44444" stroke-linejoin="round"></path>
                      </svg></div>
                    <h3 class="faq-question-text">What are common signs of a hormone imbalance?</h3>
                  </div>
                  <div class="faq-answer-wrap active">
                    <div class="faq-answer">
                      <p class="faq-answer-text">Irregular periods, acne, weight changes, low energy and mood swings can all point to a hormone imbalance. A simple blood test helps confirm it.</p>
                    </div>
                  </div>
                </div>
                <div class="faq-item">
                  <div class="faq-question">
                    <div class="faq-icon-wrap"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="100%" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none" class="faq-icon">
                        <path d="M10 3.33337V16.6667" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.44444" stroke-linejoin="round"></path>
                        <path d="M3.33301 10H16.6663" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.44444" stroke-linejoin="round"></path>
                      </svg></div>
                    <h3 class="faq-question-text">Can stress affect my cycle?</h3>
                  </div>
                  <div class="faq-answer-wrap">
                    <div class="faq-answer">
                      <p class="faq-answer-text">Yes. Long-term stress can delay ovulation or change your cycle. We can suggest practical ways to manage it alongside your care.</p>
                    </div>
                  </div>
                </div>
                <div class="faq-item">
                  <div class="faq-question">
                    <div class="faq-icon-wrap"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="100%" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none" class="faq-icon">
                        <path d="M10 3.33337V16.6667" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.44444" stroke-linejoin="round"></path>
                        <path d="M3.33301 10H16.6663" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.44444" stroke-linejoin="round"></path>
                      </svg></div>
                    <h3 class="faq-question-text">Do you offer support during menopause?</h3>
                  </div>
                  <div class="faq-answer-wrap">
                    <div class="faq-answer">
                      <p class="faq-answer-text">Yes. We help with symptoms like hot flushes, poor sleep and low mood, and discuss whether hormone therapy is right for you.</p>
                    </div>
                  </div>
                </div>
                <div class="faq-item">
                  <div class="faq-question">
                    <div class="faq-icon-wrap"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="100%" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none" class="faq-icon">
                        <path d="M10 3.33337V16.6667" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.44444" stroke-linejoin="round"></path>
                        <path d="M3.33301 10H16.6663" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.44444" stroke-linejoin="round"></path>
                      </svg></div>
                    <h3 class="faq-question-text">How often should my hormones be checked?</h3>
                  </div>
                  <div class="faq-answer-wrap">
                    <div class="faq-answer">
                      <p class="faq-answer-text">It depends on your symptoms and treatment. Many patients have a check every few months at first, then once a year when things are stable.</p>
                    </div>
                  </div>
                </div>
                <div class="faq-item">
                  <div class="faq-question">
                    <div class="faq-icon-wrap"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="100%" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none" class="faq-icon">
                        <path d="M10 3.33337V16.6667" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.44444" stroke-linejoin="round"></path>
                        <path d="M3.33301 10H16.6663" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.44444" stroke-linejoin="round"></path>
                      </svg></div>
                    <h3 class="faq-question-text">Can diet help balance my hormones?</h3>
                  </div>
                  <div class="faq-answer-wrap">
                    <div class="faq-answer">
                      <p class="faq-answer-text">A balanced diet with enough protein, fibre and healthy fats supports steady hormones. Our team can give advice that suits your needs.</p>
                    </div>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div to-top-2="" class="faq-bottom">
          <div class="faq-bottom-left">
            <div class="font-medium semibold white">Still have questions?</div>
            <p class="paragraph-regular faq">Our team is ready to answer your questions and help you book the right appointment</p>
          </div>
          <PrimaryButton href="/contact-v1" label="Book Appointment" />
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
